theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("30_kq58d")
theme_override_fonts/bold_font = ExtResource("30_kq58d")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=24][b]Deadlock Playground[/b][/font_size]
[color=#A35A4E]v1.0.0[/color]

An open-source, community-driven tool designed to view, inspect, pose, and paint 3D character models from Valve's Deadlock for art reference, virtual photography, skin creation, and modding.

[font_size=20][b]Built With & Open Source Credits[/b][/font_size]
• [b]Engine:[/b] Powered by [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://godotengine.org/]Godot Engine 4[/url][/color] (.NET / C#).
• [b]Asset Pipeline:[/b] Powered by [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://github.com/ValveResourceFormat/ValveResourceFormat]ValveResourceFormat (Source 2 Viewer)[/url][/color], maintained by the Steam Database community.
• [b]SVG Icons:[/b] [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://github.com/Voxybunsl/at-icons]at-icons (MIT License)[/url][/color] by Voxybuns.
• [b]GPU Texture Painter plugin:[/b] [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://github.com/maantho/gpu-texture-painter]GPU Texture Painter (MIT License)[/url][/color] by maantho.
• [b]Gizmo3D plugin:[/b] [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://github.com/chrisizeful/Gizmo3D]Gizmo3D (MIT License)[/url][/color] by chrisizeful.
• [b]Intro Background image:[/b] Artwork by [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://ayeaka.itch.io/ayeaka]ayeaka[/url][/color].
• [b]Project Source:[/b] Check out the code and contribute on [color=#4DA3FF][url=https://github.com/juliancz-a/deadlock-playground]GitHub[/url][/color].

[font_size=20][b]Legal Disclaimer & Intellectual Property[/b][/font_size]
[i]Deadlock, Source 2, the Source 2 logo, Valve, and the Valve logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of [b]Valve Corporation[/b]. All character models, textures, animations, and related assets extracted or rendered by this application are the copyrighted property of Valve Corporation.

This project is an unofficial, non-commercial fan creation. It is neither affiliated with, endorsed by, nor sponsored by Valve Corporation. No proprietary game files are bundled, redistributed, or sold with this software; assets are parsed locally from the user's personal installation of Deadlock.[/i]"
fit_content = true

